          "headline": "Rejetto HFS flaw found with Anthropic's Mythos model is exploited in the wild, the second such bug known to be attacked",
          "sources": [
            { "name": "The Register", "url": "https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/10/03/anthropics-super-bug-hunting-model-mythos-is-hardcore-good-at-math-as-latest-vuln-under-attack-shows/5300933" },
