            "BleepingComputer, citing TestingCatalog on X, reports references to a hidden \"Additional sandbox options\" setting in the Gemini Desktop app for macOS. If enabled, it says, Gemini \"could read, create, modify, or even delete files anywhere on your PC\" and communicate with apps such as Mail, Safari or Messages.",
