      "section": "Frontier models & labs",
      "headline": "OpenAI says it pauses training or holds back models \"when we need to slow down\", responding to its safety lead's resignation",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "B", "text": "Let's start with OpenAI, which has now answered the resignation we covered yesterday." },
