        { "host": "A", "text": "Caveats. The discovery claim comes from Horizon3.ai and Anthropic, so that part is a company claim, and the exploitation telemetry is VulnCheck's and is not independently verified. The Register doesn't say how many hosts were compromised, if any. And it's an update to a story we've been following." }
      ]
    },
